heir likely order placement; provided those lineup cards are confirmed at the projected slots, their scores remain stable. We are keeping **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, **Coby Mayo**, and **Miguel Vargas** on high alert should any last-minute defensive replacements or lineup shifts occur.",
